Note on sanitized workflow templates:

The workflow.json files in this repository are sanitized representations
of production systems. Client-specific data, API keys, credential IDs,
and proprietary business logic have been removed or replaced with
placeholder values (REPLACE_*).

These templates are shared for portfolio review and educational purposes.
They demonstrate architecture patterns and should be adapted with proper
credentials and customization before any production use.
